{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 66, :comments ["<b>All the things that he had done.</b> It includes the matter of the serpent which he performed in saying, ״הקרה נא לפני היום״ and so on, and ״הנערה״ and so on, and the adornments which he gave to Rebekah on the way, and the gifts which he gave to her and to her brother and to her mother in the house. It also includes further the matter of the contraction of the way that was performed for him — all of it he told him."], :book :genesis, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:14:52.171577398Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}